cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to Relay in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Relay: share an Android phone's internet with a Windows PC over WireGuard"
abstract: >-
  Relay shares an Android phone's internet connection, including the phone's
  VPN, with a Windows PC over an encrypted WireGuard tunnel carried on the same
  Wi-Fi, the phone's hotspot or a USB cable. It needs no root, no account and
  no server.
authors:
  - given-names: Mahdi
    family-names: Mortazavi
repository-code: "https://github.com/Mahdi-mortazavi/relay"
url: "https://mahdi-mortazavi.github.io/p/relay/"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
  - reverse tethering
  - internet sharing
  - android
  - windows
  - wireguard
  - vpn
  - tethering
